# A rejected direction leaves a multi-direction step's random-choice bag.
# With the game's power-on seed, the west worker rejects NORTH twice under
# plain rejection sampling but only once under the game's shrinking bag.  The
# resulting RNG position sends the east worker into the east hole only when
# rejected choices are removed before the next draw.
name Random Step Shrinking Bag
dim 7 5
ent wall 0 1
ent wall 1 0
ent hole 1 2
ent hole 5 2
ent worker 1 1
ent worker 4 2
goal all_exited
